---
import manifest from '../../video-manifest.json';
const { id } = Astro.props;
const item = manifest.find(x => x.id === id);
if (!item) throw new Error(`Unknown tutorial video: ${id}`);
---
<section class="tutorial-video" id="video" aria-label={`Video: ${item.title}`}>
  <h2>Tonton video</h2>
  <p>{item.duration} detik · 720p · tanpa suara · data simulasi. Direkam 5 November 2026.</p>
  <p>Teks di atas sudah memuat seluruh langkah. Video tidak wajib ditonton.</p>
  <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster={`/panduan/video/${id}-poster.png`} width="1280" height="720" aria-label={item.title}>
    <source src={`/panduan/video/${id}.mp4`} type="video/mp4" />
    <track kind="captions" src={`/panduan/video/${id}.vtt`} srclang="id" label="Bahasa Indonesia" />
    Browser ini belum mendukung video. Ikuti langkah tertulis di atas.
  </video>
  <div class="video-options">
    <label>Kecepatan video
      <select data-video-speed aria-label={`Kecepatan video ${item.title}`}>
        <option value="0.75">0,75×</option><option value="1" selected>1×</option><option value="1.25">1,25×</option><option value="1.5">1,5×</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <a href={`/panduan/video/${id}.mp4`} download>Unduh video ({item.sizeLabel})</a>
  </div>
  <p class="video-error" role="status" hidden>Video belum dapat dimuat. Kamu tetap bisa mengikuti langkah dan transkrip di halaman ini.</p>
  <details><summary>Baca transkrip video</summary><ol>{item.scenes.map(scene => <li><strong>{scene.at}.</strong> {scene.caption}</li>)}</ol></details>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.tutorial-video').forEach(section => {
    const video = section.querySelector('video')!;
    section.querySelector('select')?.addEventListener('change', event => {
      video.playbackRate = Number((event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value);
    });
    const unavailable = () => { section.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.video-error')!.hidden = false; };
    video.addEventListener('error', unavailable);
    video.querySelector('source')?.addEventListener('error', unavailable);
  });
</script>
